@dwex
title: CV-02 - Convoyer on a land field is invalid
desc:  Gilgamesch B.3.2.1 requires the convoyer to sit on a water field.
       Here the would-be convoyer Wal is a coastal LAND field. Geography
       phase rejects the con order under GEO-005 (effective_behavior =
       holds_supportable), the army's cmove route cannot complete, and
       the army stays in Lon.

map {
  Lon LCB 0, 0.0
  Wal LCB 1, 0.4
  Bre LCB 2, 0.0
  Lon -- Wal
  Wal -- Bre
}

orders {
  En A Lon mve Bre !
  En F Wal con Lon
}
@end
